{"id":"en_the-intern-reported-me","title":"The Intern Reported Me","titleEn":"The Intern Reported Me","description":"Aurora Bennett had lent her personal Cullinan, valued at 3.2 million, to the company at no cost for two years, driven by loyalty to founder Stephen Drake, a former classmate. That goodwill collapses when Sabrina Grant, a newly arrived intern, tries to advance herself by falsely claiming Aurora misused company assets. Despite their shared past, Stephen takes Sabrina's side and penalizes Aurora. Confronted with both of their real characters, Aurora resolves to stop yielding and strike back.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-intern-reported-me/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-intern-reported-me/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Face-Slap","Her Journey","Heroine","Plot Twists","RealisticFiction","SecretIdentity"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8qg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-intern-reported-me_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8qg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-intern-reported-me_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8qg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-intern-reported-me_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8qg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-intern-reported-me_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl8qg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","